{"id": "WS-ID-10", "criterion": "For pnpm dependencies, Callisto preserves the declared key, target distribution name and exact `workspace:` suffix separately. `workspace:`, `workspace:*`, `workspace:^` and `workspace:~` are version-derived shorthands; aliases such as `workspace:foo@^1` resolve `foo` while retaining the declared key; relative references resolve only to the admitted npm member at the resolved directory. Valid npm `||` alternatives are evaluated as a union for dependency coverage, while any invalid alternative makes coverage unknown. Catalog and opaque references are not guessed or rewritten."}
